OL,3,GNEWSAMI5 spied on NHS founder Nye Bevan
OL,4,Afor more than 20 years, newly released
OL,5,Afiles show
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS founder Aneurin "Nye" Bevan was
OL,8,Fspied on by MI5 for more than 20 years,
OL,9,Faccording to newly released files.
OL,11,FPapers given to the National Archives
OL,12,Fshow he first came to the attention of
OL,13,Fthe Security Service in the 1930s when
OL,14,Fhe was considered a firebrand
OL,15,Fleft-winger linked to prominent
OL,16,Fcommunists.
