OL,3,GNEWSAMI5 spied on NHS founder Nye Bevan
OL,4,Afor more than 20 years, newly released
OL,5,Afiles show
OL,6,
OL,7,FMonitoring continued after Bevan, from
OL,8,FTredegar, Blaenau Gwent, became a
OL,9,Fminister in the post-war Labour
OL,10,Fgovernment when he drove through the
OL,11,Fcreation of the NHS in the face of
OL,12,Fopposition from doctors.
OL,14,FAt one stage the-then MI5 director
OL,15,Fgeneral became so concerned about his
OL,16,Flinks to a Russian spy that he went to
OL,17,Fsee Prime Minister Clement Attlee in No
OL,18,F10 to warn him.
